# System Design Mental Model

Think about a system in layers:

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Users / Clients]
    B[Networking]
    C[Edge]
    D[Application]
    E[Async Processing]
    F[Data]
    G[Storage]
    H[Observability]
    I[Security]

    A --> B
    B --> C
    C --> D
    D --> E
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G

    H -.-> B
    H -.-> C
    H -.-> D
    H -.-> E
    H -.-> F

    I -.-> B
    I -.-> C
    I -.-> D
    I -.-> F
```

For every component ask:

1. What does it do?
2. Why do we need it?
3. What happens if it fails?
4. How does it scale?
5. How much does it cost?
6. How is it monitored?
7. How is it secured?
8. Can we replace it later?

