# 6. Multi-Region / Multi-Data-Centre Architecture

Deploying systems in multiple geographic locations reduces latency and can improve availability.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    U[Global Users]

    U --> DNS[Global Traffic Manager]

    DNS --> US[US Region]
    DNS --> EU[EU Region]
    DNS --> APAC[APAC Region]

    US --> USDB[(US DB)]
    EU --> EUDB[(EU DB)]
    APAC --> APDB[(APAC DB)]
```

### Examples

* AWS regions
* Azure regions
* Google Cloud regions
* Cloudflare edge
* Kubernetes clusters across regions

### Trade-off

Multi-region introduces complexity:

* Replication
* Data consistency
* Failover
* Conflict resolution
* Operational cost
* Deployment coordination

