# 10. GraphQL

GraphQL allows clients to request exactly the fields they need.

REST:

```text
GET /users/123
GET /users/123/orders
GET /users/123/preferences
```

GraphQL:

```graphql
query {
  user(id: "123") {
    name
    email
    orders {
      id
      total
    }
  }
}
```

### Strengths

* Flexible queries
* Strong schema
* Good frontend experience
* Avoids some over-fetching

### Weaknesses

* More server complexity
* Query-cost control
* Caching complexity
* Authorization complexity

