# 12. Vertical Scaling

Scaling up means making one machine more powerful.

```text
4 CPU
↓
16 CPU
↓
64 CPU
```

Advantages:

* Simple
* Minimal architecture change
* Easy operationally

Disadvantages:

* Hardware limit
* Expensive
* Single point of failure
* Limited long-term scalability

