# 14. Load Balancing

A load balancer distributes traffic across servers.

Algorithms include:

* Round robin
* Weighted round robin
* Least connections
* IP hashing
* Consistent hashing
* Latency-based routing

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    C[Clients] --> LB[Load Balancer]

    LB --> A[API A]
    LB --> B[API B]
    LB --> C2[API C]

    A --> DB[(Database)]
    B --> DB
    C2 --> DB
```

It can also perform:

* Health checks
* TLS termination
* Routing
* Failover
* Connection management

