# 20. Denormalization

Normalization reduces duplication.

Denormalization intentionally duplicates data to improve read performance.

Normalized:

```text
Users
Orders
Products
```

Denormalized:

```text
UserOrders
├── user_name
├── order_id
├── product_name
└── order_total
```

Advantages:

* Faster reads
* Fewer joins
* Better read scalability

Disadvantages:

* More storage
* Duplicate data
* Update complexity
* Consistency challenges

