# 22. Blob / Object Storage

Databases aren't usually the best place for large binary files.

Use object storage for:

* Images
* Videos
* PDFs
* Audio
* Backups
* Large datasets
* ML artifacts

Examples:

* Amazon S3
* Azure Blob Storage
* Google Cloud Storage
* Cloudflare R2
* MinIO

Architecture:

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    U[User] --> API[API]
    API --> URL[Signed Upload URL]
    URL --> OBJ[(Object Storage)]
```

The backend doesn't need to stream every large file through itself.

