# 25. Webhooks

Webhooks are event-driven callbacks.

Instead of:

```text
Your app → "Did payment complete?"
Your app → "Did payment complete?"
Your app → "Did payment complete?"
```

The provider calls your system:

```text
Payment completed
       ↓
POST /webhooks/payment
       ↓
Your application
```

Examples:

* Stripe
* GitHub
* Shopify
* Slack
* Microsoft Graph
* HubSpot

### Must-have webhook features

* Signature verification
* Idempotency
* Retry handling
* Event IDs
* Dead-letter handling
* Logging
* Replay capability

