# 35. Observability

Modern systems cannot rely on logs alone.

Observability normally includes:

```text
Logs
Metrics
Traces
```

OpenTelemetry is a vendor-neutral framework for generating, collecting and exporting telemetry, including traces, metrics and logs.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    APP[Application]

    APP --> LOGS[Logs]
    APP --> METRICS[Metrics]
    APP --> TRACES[Traces]

    LOGS --> OTEL[OpenTelemetry]
    METRICS --> OTEL
    TRACES --> OTEL

    OTEL --> BACKEND[Observability Backend]
```

