# 42. Distributed Transactions

Traditional:

```text
BEGIN
A
B
C
COMMIT
```

Across services, this becomes difficult.

Common patterns:

* Saga
* Outbox pattern
* Event-driven workflows
* Compensating transactions

Example:

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    O[Create Order]
    P[Reserve Payment]
    I[Reserve Inventory]
    S[Ship]

    O --> P
    P --> I
    I --> S

    I -.failure.-> CP[Compensate Payment]
```

