# Reliability Engineering

A production system should explicitly define failure handling.

## Failure Matrix

| Failure              | Detection       | Response             |
| -------------------- | --------------- | -------------------- |
| API timeout          | Metrics         | Retry                |
| DB unavailable       | Health check    | Failover             |
| Queue failure        | Broker metrics  | Retry                |
| Worker crash         | Heartbeat       | Restart              |
| External API failure | Tracing         | Circuit breaker      |
| Duplicate request    | Idempotency key | Ignore/replay result |
| Message poison       | Retry count     | DLQ                  |
| Region failure       | Health checks   | Failover             |
| Cache failure        | Cache metrics   | DB fallback          |
| Model failure        | AI gateway      | Model fallback       |

