# CQRS

Command Query Responsibility Segregation separates writes and reads.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    COMMAND[Commands] --> WRITE[Write Model]
    WRITE --> DB[(Primary DB)]

    DB --> READMODEL[Read Model]
    READMODEL --> QUERY[Queries]
```

Useful when:

* Read and write patterns are very different
* Read performance needs independent optimisation
* Event-driven architecture exists

Don't use it just because it sounds advanced.

